<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Delvita issues CZK 1bln, five-yr bonds -lead.</title>
<headline>Czech Delvita issues CZK 1bln, five-yr bonds -lead.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech subsidiary of Belgian supermarket chain Delvita has issued a one billion crown tranche of five-year callable bonds, lead manager Patria Finance said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Patria added that the bonds, which have a 12.5 percent annual coupon, were issued at par.</p>
</text>
